melody:
# Chorus
Swing low, sweet cha-ri-ot,
A4 F4(2) A4 F4. F4/ D4/ ~C4.
com-ing for to car-ry me home.
F4/ F4/ F4/ F4/ A4/ A4/ C5 C5(4)
Swing low, sweet cha-ri-ot,
D5/ ~C5/ A4(2) C5 F4. F4/ D4/ ~C4.
com-ing for to car-ry me home.
F4/ F4/ F4/ F4/ A4/ A4/ G4 F4(3)

# Verse 1
I looked o-ver Jor-dan, and what did I see,
A4 C5 F4/ C4/ F4 F4/ F4/ F4/ F4/ F4 D4/ ~C4.
com-ing for to car-ry me home?
F4/ F4/ F4/ F4/ A4/ A4/ C5 C5(3)
A band of an-gels com-ing af-ter me,
C5 D5/ ~C5/ A4 A4 F4 F4/ F4/ F4/ F4/ D4/ ~C4.
com-ing for to car-ry me home.
F4/ F4/ F4/ F4/ A4/ A4/ G4 F4(4)

